        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "In this guide, ReNUWIt (Stanford) graduate student Adam Simpson offers insights and suggestions for students applying to graduate school. Topics covered include deciding on a program, approaching potential research faculty, taking the GRE, applying for fellowships, requesting letters of recommendation, and submitting the application. A sample application preparation timeline is also provided.",
